	"descriptionMarkdown": "# 🌟 Legendary Quality Item Manufacturing – Factorio: Space Age\n\nAn advanced, fully automated **legendary-quality manufacturing system** built around parameterized blueprints, circuit-controlled production, and automatic recycling.\n\nThe system automatically detects available ingredient qualities, selects a suitable crafting quality, and recycles lower-quality products to maximize your chances of obtaining **legendary items**.\n\nSimply select the item you want to manufacture, configure your target production quantity, and let the system handle the rest!\n\n## ✨ Key Features\n\n- 🌟 **Legendary Item Production** – Designed to manufacture legendary-quality items through automated crafting and recycling.\n- ⚙️ **Parameterized Blueprints** – Select your desired recipe and automatically configure ingredient requests and production settings.\n- 🎲 **Automatic Quality Selection** – Circuit logic detects available ingredients across all 5 quality tiers and selects a suitable crafting quality.\n- 🔄 **Automatic Recycling** – Lower-quality products are automatically routed through recyclers for another chance at higher quality.\n- 🧠 **Smart Circuit Control** – Decider and selector combinators manage recipe selection, ingredient availability, and machine operation.\n- ⏱️ **Stable Quality Switching** – The quality selector updates every 200 ticks (approximately 3.33 seconds), reducing frequent recipe changes.\n- 📦 **Dynamic Ingredient Requests** – Logistic requests automatically adapt to ingredient stack sizes, recipe requirements, and crafting time.\n- 🎯 **Configurable Production Targets** – Set your desired output quantity in stacks.\n- 🤖 **Logistic Network Integration** – Requester and provider chests automate ingredient delivery and finished-product collection.\n- 📈 **Multiple Buffer Configurations** – Choose between smaller ingredient buffers or larger stockpiles for sustained production.\n\n## 🏭 Included Blueprints\n\nThe blueprint book contains **12 blueprints**, covering:\n\n**Legendary Manufacturing Systems:**\n\n- Assembling Machine 3\n- Electromagnetic Plant\n- Foundry\n- Chemical Plant\n- Biochamber\n\nEach manufacturing system comes in **two configurations** with different ingredient buffer capacities.\n\n**Additional Blueprints:**\n\n- Build Anything Assembler\n- Build Anything (Electromagnetic Plant)\n\nThese additional blueprints provide simpler parameterized production setups without the full quality-recycling system.\n\n## 🚀 Getting Started\n\n1. Select the blueprint for your desired production machine.\n2. Choose the item you want to manufacture using blueprint parameters.\n3. Configure the target number of output stacks.\n4. Place the blueprint and connect it to your logistic network.\n5. Provide any required fluids or other recipe-specific inputs.\n\nThe circuit network will automatically check ingredient availability and select suitable crafting qualities.\n\n## ⚠️ Important Notes\n\n- **Factorio: Space Age is required.** The system uses quality mechanics, recyclers, and expansion-specific machines.\n- The blueprints contain legendary-quality production machines and quality modules.\n- By default, lower-quality finished products are recycled. You can modify the filters on the fast inserters to keep lower-quality results instead.\n- Production efficiency depends on ingredient availability, logistic network capacity, and recipe requirements.\n- Recipes must be compatible with the selected production machine.\n\n---\n\n**One recipe, five quality tiers, automated recycling — your path to legendary manufacturing!**\n",
